# Spec Kit — installed tooling and local machine state, not project source.
# .specify/memory/ is the exception: it's the authoring spec content AGENTS.md
# documents as the authoritative view, so it stays tracked.
.claude/skills/speckit-**
.gemini/commands/speckit.**
.github/agents/speckit.**
.github/prompts/speckit.**
.kilocode/workflows/speckit.**
.specify/*
!.specify/archive/
!.specify/memory/
!.specify/feature.json
specs/archive/
specs/drafts/

# Spec Kit quality-gate checklists: useful only while a feature is being
# specified/planned, redundant once implemented — never commit these.
specs/*/checklists/requirements.md
